        "A1": "✨ SPREADSHEET OCA — FEATURES GUIDE",
        "A3": "1) In the File menu:",
        "A4": "  • File > Download XLSX (Spreadsheet OCA)",
        "A5": "  • File > Download PDF (Spreadsheet PDF Report module, Unicode fonts)",
        "A6": "  • File > Save as Template (Spreadsheet Template module)",
        "A7": "  • File > Add to dashboard (Spreadsheet Dashboard module)",
        "A9": "2) In the Data menu:",
        "A10": "  • Data > KPI Alerts (Spreadsheet KPI Alert module)",
        "A12": "3) Smart buttons on the spreadsheet form:",
        "A13": "  • KPI Alerts (number of alerts)",
        "A14": "  • Versions (version history)",
        "A15": "  • New Snapshot (save a version right now)",
        "A17": "4) Spreadsheets app menu structure:",
        "A18": "  • Spreadsheets (main list)",
        "A19": "  • Templates",
        "A20": "  • Contracts & SLA",
        "A21": "  • Consolidation (multi-company)",
        "A22": "  • Help & Examples (tutorials, these guides and sample data)",
        "A23": "  • Configuration >",
        "A24": "      KPI Alerts, API Tokens, Public Share Links",
        "A25": "      Refresh Schedules, Email Reports",
        "A26": "      Portal Dashboards, Dashboard Data Filters",
        "A27": "      Template Categories",
        "A29": "5) Settings > Spreadsheet:",
        "A30": "  The settings of all Spreadsheet modules in one section"
